{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手詹天文（Windy）今日（15日）現身黃竹坑出席粉絲見面會，現場不但與粉絲大玩小遊戲，送上禮品包及自製霓虹燈牌，更獻唱了《Seeds of Truth》、《無疾而終》及最新單曲《得來全花費功夫》，炒熱全場氣氛！</p><p>Windy受訪時表示為了見</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:39:29.614430+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:33:03.583487+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:33:03.583487+00:00","content_hash":"90891cd931e9257628b42d952547d843c168409d19615f5aa1a2f03cba3ed1cd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}